  "statement": "SingularSetSmallWhereDensityBelowTwo of the frozen contract (Simon 7.4.4). For all n, k, ℓ ∈ ℕ with ℓ ≤ k, all sets U, N ⊆ ℝ^{n+k} and every T ∈ 𝒟_n(U): if U is open, N is an embedded C² (n+ℓ)-dimensional submanifold, (closure N ∖ N) ∩ U = ∅, T is minimizing in U ∩ N, spt T ⊆ U ∩ N and ∂T = 0 in U, then for every ξ ∈ spt T and every real θ with HasMassDensity T ξ θ and θ < 2 there is ρ > 0 such that μH[n − 2 + α](sing T ∩ B_ρ(ξ)) = 0 for every real α > 0 (sing T = singularSet T = spt T ∖ regularSet T).",
